of attorney contained =E2=80=9Cno express power=E2=80=9D to accept debts, s=
o no
such power had been given. <em>Ibid.</em><p></p>

															Other examples abound. A power to sell casks of
whiskey did not include the =E2=80=9Cunusual and extraordinary=E2=80=9D pow=
